## Next Steps

* **Attestation-Based Client Authentication**: The authors of `draft-ietf-oauth-attestation-based-client-auth` will work with the SPIFFE profiling team to resolve the feedback on the `sub` claim, key rotation, and JWT types to prepare the document for Working Group Last Call (WGLC).
* **Deferred Token Response**: The authors will collaborate with the authors of the transaction challenge and asynchronous interaction drafts to align polling mechanisms and explore merging overlapping drafts.